<title>UK: Boxing-World title fight results.</title>
<headline>Boxing-World title fight results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on Saturday of world title boxing fights at the London Arena:</p>
<p>World Boxing Council (WBC) super-middleweight:</p>
<p>Robin Reid (Britain) (holder) knocked out Giovanni Pretorius (South Africa) in the seventh round.  </p>
<p>World featherweight unifier:</p>
<p>&quot;Prince&quot; Naseem Hamed (Britain) (WBO holder) stopped Tom Johnson (U.S.) (IBF holder) in the eighth round.</p>
</text>
